# ==========================================
# DocMind API — REST Client
# ==========================================
# 使用说明:
# 1. 安装 VS Code 插件: REST Client (humao.rest-client)
# 2. 点击请求上方的 "Send Request" 链接即可发送
# 3. 快捷键: Cmd+Alt+R (macOS) / Ctrl+Alt+R (Windows/Linux)
# 4. 每个请求之间用 "###" 分隔
# ==========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "super_admin",
  "password": "super_admin"
}

# 登录成功后，token 自动从响应中提取，后续请求直接使用 {{token}}
@token = {{login.response.body.data.access_token}}

### 列出当前用户的文档列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/ingest/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 删除文档
# 将 {doc_id} 替换为要删除的文档 ID（从文档列表中获取）
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/ingest/{doc_id}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 上传文档
# doc_type:   requirement | postmortem | pitfall | sharing | tech_spec
# service:    collection | risk | admin | all  （逗号分隔多值）
# department: backend | qa | ios | android | web | all  （逗号分隔多值）
# 知识库由登录用户的 JWT 自动决定，无需手动指定
# @name ingest
POST {{baseUrl}}/ingest
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="常见行为错误前期汇总.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

< /Users/david/Downloads/常见行为错误前期汇总.md
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

常见行为错误前期汇总
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="url"

https://ai-api.surfin.sg/
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="doc_type"

all
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="service"

all
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="department"

all
------Boundary--

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chatInput": "总结下需求流程开发规范",
  "sessionId": "user-123"
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chatInput": "刚才说的第三点，能详细说说吗？",
  "sessionId": "user-123"
}

